data: {"id": "e49d586cab774800-thinking-parallel_evidence-1275", "run_id": "e49d586cab774800", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与根因判断\n\n**1. 状态确认 (Metrics & K8s Core):**\n- **Phase**: Pod 处于 `Pending`，容器状态 `Waiting (ContainerCreating)`。\n- **Restart**: 0 次，说明从未成功运行过。\n- **Timeline**: 创建时间 `10:49:27`，至今未改变。\n\n**2. 根因定位 (Kubectl Describe & YAML):**\n- **直接原因**: `describe` 输出明确显示 Warning 事件 `NoNetworkFound` 和 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`。\n- **具体错误**: 缺失网络附件定义 (NetworkAttachmentDefinition) `'unavailable-network'`。\n- **配置引用**: Pod 的 `annotations` 中指定了 `k8s.v1.cni.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`。\n- **排除项**: \n  - `ima", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788781654295, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

